cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "pykeo: GNSS TEC calibration and keograms"
abstract: >-
  pykeo turns daily RINEX observation files from a network of GNSS receivers
  into calibrated vertical Total Electron Content (vTEC) and detrended TEC
  (dTEC) at the ionospheric pierce points, and plots the dTEC as
  latitude–time keograms.
